--   - 30 contracts (one per worker, all finalised, all started)
--   - 1 UPDATE promotions SET announcerN (using contractIDs!)
--   - 3 tag teams
--   - 2 stables (4 members each, with isLeader=1 on first member)
--   - 2 storylines (2 participants each, contractIDs verified)
